---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Terms of sale — Publitools';
const description = 'Terms of sale for Publitools published by PubliTech OÜ.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical="https://publitools.ai/en/terms-of-sale" locale="en" pathname="/en/terms-of-sale/">
  <main class="container section-pad">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f4862d]">Contractual documents</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#262832]">Terms of sale</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 text-[#5b6170]">
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">1. Seller identity</h2><p class="mt-4">These terms of sale govern the services provided under the Publitools brand by <strong class="text-[#262832]">PubliTech OÜ</strong>, a company registered under code <strong class="text-[#262832]">17324362</strong>, VAT <strong class="text-[#262832]">EE102901191</strong>, headquartered at <strong class="text-[#262832]">Harju maakond, Tallinn, Kesklinna linnaosa, Tornimäe tn 5, 10145</strong>.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">2. Subject of the services</h2><p class="mt-4">Publitools sells marketing automation software services, including content creation, social media management, customer reviews handling and certain Google Business-related features.</p><p class="mt-4">The services offered may evolve at any time to improve the product, add or remove features, or adapt to technical or commercial constraints.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">3. Order and subscription</h2><p class="mt-4">Any subscription to a Publitools plan or service implies unreserved acceptance of these terms of sale. The order is deemed valid as soon as it is confirmed via the site, the application or any other subscription path made available by the publisher.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">4. Prices</h2><p class="mt-4">Prices are indicated in euros, unless stated otherwise. Applicable prices are those displayed on the day of subscription. PubliTech OÜ reserves the right to change its prices at any time for new subscriptions or under the contractual terms provided.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">5. Payment</h2><p class="mt-4">Payment is made according to the terms indicated at the time of order. For subscriptions, renewal, billing frequency and payment methods are specified at sign-up.</p><p class="mt-4">In the event of a payment issue, the publisher reserves the right to suspend access to the service until the situation is resolved.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">6. Term and termination</h2><p class="mt-4">Subscription duration, termination conditions and the effects of any service interruption are those indicated at sign-up or in the user account interface. Unless stated otherwise, the customer may request the cancellation of their subscription under the terms provided by the service.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">7. Customer obligations</h2><p class="mt-4">The customer agrees to provide accurate information, to use the service in a lawful manner, and not to misuse the features for illegal, deceptive or regulatory-breach purposes.</p><p class="mt-4">The customer remains solely responsible for the content, publications, images, text or messages they validate and publish via Publitools.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">8. Limitation of liability</h2><p class="mt-4">Publitools is a productivity, automation and assistance tool. The publisher does not guarantee a given volume of visibility, a specific number of reviews, or a specific commercial result. Performance depends on the customer's usage, their business, their content, their market and the third-party platforms used.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">9. Governing law</h2><p class="mt-4">These terms are subject to the applicable law determined by the publisher's structure and, where applicable, by the mandatory rules applicable to the contractual relations concerned.</p></section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>